Scope and nature of the data
----------------------------
This dataset publishes DERIVED FACTUAL DATA only:
  - canonical/normalized dish names,
  - structured ingredient lists with quantities and normalized units,
  - estimated ingredient weights (in grams) with an explicit `weight_source`,
  - per-ingredient and per-recipe nutrition values,
  - master-ingredient nutrition references,
  - the original `source_url` and `source_platform` for provenance.

It does NOT redistribute the copyrighted expressive content of the source
websites: original step-by-step instruction prose, editorial descriptions,
photographs, or original creative titles are NOT included in the released
data. Factual elements (ingredient lists, quantities, nutrition figures, and
cooking procedures as functional facts) are not subject to copyright.

The `data/raw/recipes_raw_scraped.json` snapshot, which contains verbatim
source text and media URLs, is retained only locally for reproducibility and
is excluded from the published/tracked dataset.

